<title>UK: Buenos Aires adds 50 mln Swiss francs to 7-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Buenos Aires adds 50 mln Swiss francs to 7-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PROVINCE OF BUENOS AIRES</p>
<p> AMT   *50 MLN SFR    COUPON     7.75 PCT  MATURITY    23.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.00    PAY DATE    23.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB-</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINAL LAUNCHED FOR 150 MLN SWISS FRANCS</p>
<p>		**ORIGINAL ISSUE PRICE 101.625</p>
<p>		SUBSCRIPTIONS END OCTOBER 11</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
